#~ msgstr "ULTIMATE: Plants a seed ahead that grows into a Tree of Life lasting 12s, knocking back nearby creatures as it sprouts. Every second a fruit drops for allies in its shade (you included), restoring 15% of attack power + 1% of max health as health and 8% of attack power as mana shield. Every 2s its roots reach the 3 nearest creatures, dealing 40% of attack power and rooting them for 4s (bosses aren't rooted, slowed by 30%). As it withers it leaves 3 flowers around it. (60s cooldown)"

#~ msgid "Atış"
#~ msgstr "Shot"

